To: linux-aspeed@lists.ozlabs.org
Cc: Andrew Jeffery <andrew@aj.id.au>, robh+dt@kernel.org, mark.rutland@arm.com, joel@jms.id.au, devicetree@vger.kernel.org, linux-arm-kernel@lists.infradead.org, linux-kernel@vger.kernel.org, Haiyue Wang <haiyue.wang@linux.intel.com>, Corey Minyard <minyard@acm.org>, Arnd Bergmann <arnd@arndb.de>, Greg Kroah-Hartman <gregkh@linuxfoundation.org>, openipmi-developer@lists.sourceforge.net
